omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YKksxB5cI9cQ7kNvwFfSobO&_nc_oc=AdpYTqdr7D67Mgr9XaQeCZpJ17DVdf3go-d9R0zXuWTFC4_B4NwIh1DvyUiG5WHMZrA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af79ntS48f1RLfS-6hU_TZGJtoj2FzTSirwH82uKEUJhcQ&oe=6A00A2B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p7vZ1SQRIucQ7kNvwEDKOkj&_nc_oc=AdoKNLN8r3P-k4DxuSxcEUpMPxhvwNWT6-keFnCb7wUZVPcRbyzHotsTPyhvbWjxEgE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4ma6akXZUc5QwGm-wtJ0WQdZNC7yw7HDP9J_18T9gdsA&oe=6A00A416"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QCUX7znUbUYQ7kNvwHrRE-2&_nc_oc=AdpsfVm1-Yag8M-VYpLuV1dtrO_OVVm24-qIV73OZQX9bBmoNmImxtGXQdrTfOsg86M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7qMKfAznh0kw71tQENOwHEJJJvVMVSl34eKzW5IZ1cCw&oe=6A0080F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://